                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-10-24"><hi rendition="#small-caps">October</hi> 24,
                            1900</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that the Emperor’s intention to remove both Yangtze viceroys is
                    reported by Wilcox. Directs Mr. Conger to consult his colleagues and protest
                    energetically if such action is probable.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
